@mmann78 **Please** do more testing locally. It's still too many issues with this refactoring and I'm slightly tired of doing the same testing over and over.

21. This is a variant of 18. Delete a profile. Create a new profile with the same name. Delete the already deleted profile. Now the new profile is marked as deleted. Press Ok, observe the new profile is selected but not found in the list. The "New profile" is not found but still exists, and will suddenly show up again. ![Screenshot_2026-03-24_at_12.39.28](/uploads/f1c380353e307db83e8aef7e97b58f94/Screenshot_2026-03-24_at_12.39.28.png){width=703 height=418}![Screenshot_2026-03-24_at_12.34.42](/uploads/ff7c7b05714578951b5154a0c4e21e10/Screenshot_2026-03-24_at_12.34.42.png){width=200 height=140}
22. The hint label for a deleted profile has a link to the profile. I think it should not. ![Screenshot_2026-03-24_at_12.44.34](/uploads/536ecc06679d193abc46d60c18a66e2d/Screenshot_2026-03-24_at_12.44.34.png){width=744 height=457}

The sorting in the popup is still wrong.

```suggestion:-0+0
        // Count the number of user profiles selected
```

```suggestion:-0+0
        // Can't delete Global profiles or deleted profiles
```

```suggestion:-0+0
    // Handle hints
```

```suggestion:-0+0
        // If only one profile is selected, display it's path in the hint label and activate link (if allowed)
```

```suggestion:-0+0
    // Don't allow the user to select a deleted profile, unless it's the default profile which cannot be deleted
```

```suggestion:-0+0
        // If not restoring a deleted profile, add a new one
```

```suggestion:-0+0
    // Delete button should be disabled after deleting the selected profiles, as they are now either deleted or invalid
```

```suggestion:-0+0
        // If the current profile has been deleted, reset to default
```

